ype":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L221","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:221"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The form API handling the failed submission."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"value","children":[{"type":"text","value":"value"}]},{"type":"code","value":"value: TFormData;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L219","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:219"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The form values for the failed submission."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"tformerrortypes","text":"TFormErrorTypes","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"formapi","text":"formApi","level":3},{"id":"value","text":"value","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:214](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L214)\n\nContext passed to `onSubmitInvalid` when a submission fails.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n{\n  // ...\n  onSubmitInvalid: () => {\n    document\n      .querySelector<HTMLElement>('[aria-invalid=\"true\"]')\n      ?.focus()\n  },\n}\n```\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormErrorTypes\n\n`TFormErrorTypes` *extends* [`FormErrorTypes`](FormErrorTypes.md)\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Properties\n\n### formApi\n\n```ts\nformApi: FormApi<TFormData, TFormErrorTypes>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:221](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L221)\n\nThe form API handling the failed submission.\n\n***\n\n### value\n\n```ts\nvalue: TFormData;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:219](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L219)\n\nThe form values for the failed submission.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: FormSubmitInvalidContext\ntitle: FormSubmitInvalidContext\n---\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:214](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L214)\n\nContext passed to `onSubmitInvalid` when a submission fails.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\n{\n  // ...\n  onSubmitInvalid: () => {\n    document\n      .querySelector<HTMLElement>('[aria-invalid=\"true\"]')\n      ?.focus()\n  },\n}\n```\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormErrorTypes\n\n`TFormErrorTypes` *extends* [`FormErrorTypes`](FormErrorTypes.md)\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Properties\n\n### formApi\n\n```ts\nformApi: FormApi<TFormData, TFormErrorTypes>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:221](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L221)\n\nThe form API handling the failed submission.\n\n***\n\n### value\n\n```ts\nvalue: TFormData;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:219](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L219)\n\nThe form values for the failed submission.\n"}
